  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Day after day, run after run, put your faith in the ASICS GEL-Kayano 14 to experience running bliss! Back with their late 2000s aesthetic as a nod to the storied GEL-KAYANO series, these updated shoes combine retro running flavor with modern design to make your running a stunning affair. The TRUSSTIC support system boosts confidence to pound through pavements or log those long marathons with enhanced stability. The durable rubber outsole will amaze you too, adding an element of long-lasting support and reliable traction. Grippy comfort, timeless style, and reliable speed‚Äîhave it all on your feet with the ASICS GEL-Kayano 14.</p> <p><strong>ASICS GEL-Kayano 14 features: </strong></p> <ul> <li>Mesh upper offers breathability. </li> <li>EVA midsole tooling with GEL technology cushioning provides excellent shock absorption.</li> </ul> <p>*This version is the first iteration in the sneaker‚Äôs lineage designed by ASICS designer Toshikazu Kayano. </p><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for a sneaker that blends throwback running style with dependable comfort. The ASICS GEL-Kayano 14 brings late-2000s performance-inspired design into your everyday rotation with breathable mesh, layered synthetic details, and cushioning that helps keep every step smooth and supported. Originally part of the storied GEL-Kayano line and designed as the first version in the series created by Toshikazu Kayano, this pair balances heritage looks with wear-all-day ease.</p> <ul><li>Breathable mesh upper with layered synthetic overlays</li><li>EVA midsole tooling with GEL technology cushioning for soft shock absorption</li><li>TRUSSTIC support system for a stable feel</li><li>Durable rubber outsole for everyday traction</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Most shoppers praise the comfort and support right away. For the best fit, consider going up a half size if you prefer extra toe room, plan to wear socks, or have wider feet.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for everyday wear, long hours on your feet, and adding retro running style to casual outfits.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p> <p>Reviewers love how easily this silhouette moves from daily errands to all-day wear, with a sporty look that feels equally at home with athletic pieces and laid-back streetwear. Its classic runner shape and layered ASICS details give it standout style without losing that easy, wear-with-anything appeal.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-Kayano 14 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Sweet Pink/Cream</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A537-103</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 39.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.1</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 41.4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td st